    "observations": [
      "The 320px quiet pose now leaves the full squid silhouette above the paired movement and action controls.",
      "The landscape bank sits to the right of the squid at the retained quiet pose.",
      "The portrait approach hint uses the right action bank, leaving most of the mantle visible; its edge can touch the fin tip, so this does not establish universal model clearance.",
      "The desktop achievement toast sits above the active strike hint with a visible gap.",
      "Solid rock bases no longer show the earlier bright contact strips, and the retained squid fins and plant surfaces show no obvious new shadow striping."
    ],
    "limits": [
      "Static retained poses do not establish smooth animation, universal visibility or measured FPS.",
      "Both-face rock casting can increase shadow raster work; resource counts remain fixed."
    ]
  },
