    },
    "limits": [
      "Acceptance covers these four retained natural poses, not every species, depth, camera angle, active hint or display size.",
      "Long larger-text hints, native input release, popup geometry and responsive focus depend on the separate native regressions; static captures alone do not establish those behaviors.",
      "Projection and HUD differences at 1280px are intentional consequences of using the actual fine-pointer desktop layout instead of the baseline forced touch layout.",
      "This review makes no hardware FPS or broad performance claim."
    ]
